ees are facing huge trouble. Please restore electricity immediately! 🙏⚡\n\nLocation hat Dubkul Durga mandir, bara pokkher Dubkul, Sahapur @WBSEDCL1 @SuvenduWB https://t.co/po76slPuvy","url":"https://x.com/RatanBa24872764/status/2111456329273688295"},{"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-16T16:38:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111134742926303445"],"id":"2111134742926303445","in_reply_to_user_id":"1632405205089394689","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":76,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111065879538753870","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@bong_politics @pooja_news kichu din pore bolchi, ekhono ei list er onek thakur dekha hoi ni. Tobe mone hocche lame list. Allen Park er oi pandal e ki paribesh sochetonota er mesaage ache? Same with Ajeyo Sanghati, ora theme koreche Independence movement er, but prize peyeche ei.","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111134742926303445"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111111797810008064"]},"author_id":"16093478","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:09:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111112277894283692"],"id":"2111112277894283692","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":7221,"like_count":221,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":54},"text":"The myths say, Lord Shiva drank poison during Samudra Manthan to save all of creation. But today, marine animals are being endangered by the poison of plastic that humans throw away. Who will protect them?\n\nThis year, Ballygunge 71 Palli’s Durga Puja theme is ‘Samudra Darpan’ https://t.co/P0alBkmtdp","url":"https://x.com/thebetterindia/status/2111112277894283692"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110798965801439234","3_2110798984080228352","3_2110798996646297601","3_2110799035275890688"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-15T18:24:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110799050035662929"],"id":"2110799050035662929","public_metrics":{"bookmark_